*! cleanplots13 v1.1.0 Trenton Mize 2026-10-12
*! Ordinal companion scheme to cleanplots: 13 sequential cividis colors
*
* Inherits the primary cleanplots scheme via #include. Overrides colors
* in Stata's 15 plot slots, while retaining independent line patterns
* and marker symbols. Ordered categories run from light yellow to dark navy.
*
* Color source: cividis (Nunez, Anderton, & Renslow 2018), sampled at end=.95 and direction=-1.
* Matching R scale:
*   scale_color_viridis_d(option = "cividis", end = 0.95, direction = -1)
*
* Colors recycle after 13 series when there are more than 13 plots.
* The 15 plot styles retain their own line patterns and marker symbols.
* Bar/area fills inherit cleanplots' 70 percent intensity.
*
* Example: graph bar price, over(rep78) asyvars scheme(cleanplots13)

#include cleanplots

color p1              "246 221 77"
color p1line          "246 221 77"
color p1lineplot      "246 221 77"
color p1markline      "246 221 77"
color p1bar           "246 221 77"
color p1barline       "246 221 77"
color p1area          "246 221 77"
color p1arealine      "246 221 77"
color p1pie           "246 221 77"
linepattern p1line solid
linepattern p1lineplot solid
symbol p1 smcircle

color p2              "222 202 95"
color p2line          "222 202 95"
color p2lineplot      "222 202 95"
color p2markline      "222 202 95"
color p2bar           "222 202 95"
color p2barline       "222 202 95"
color p2area          "222 202 95"
color p2arealine      "222 202 95"
color p2pie           "222 202 95"
linepattern p2line dash
linepattern p2lineplot dash
symbol p2 smsquare

color p3              "200 184 106"
color p3line          "200 184 106"
color p3lineplot      "200 184 106"
color p3markline      "200 184 106"
color p3bar           "200 184 106"
color p3barline       "200 184 106"
color p3area          "200 184 106"
color p3arealine      "200 184 106"
color p3pie           "200 184 106"
linepattern p3line shortdash
linepattern p3lineplot shortdash
symbol p3 smtriangle

color p4              "179 167 114"
color p4line          "179 167 114"
color p4lineplot      "179 167 114"
color p4markline      "179 167 114"
color p4bar           "179 167 114"
color p4barline       "179 167 114"
color p4area          "179 167 114"
color p4arealine      "179 167 114"
color p4pie           "179 167 114"
linepattern p4line longdash
linepattern p4lineplot longdash
symbol p4 smdiamond

